        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.22.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Icite 22:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Solomoni atendeka ukukuula iŋanda yakwa Yawe mu Yerusalemu pa lupili lwa Moriya, palya Lesa amonekele wishi Davidi. Cali ni pa lubansa lwakutwilapo ulwakwa Arauna umwina Yebusi, incende iyo Davidi apekenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa bushiku bwalenga shibili mu mweshi walenga ibili mu mwaka walenga bune uwa pa bufumu, epo atendeke ukukuula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umufula Solomoni apangile uwakukuulapo iŋanda yakwa Lesa wali amakubiti amakumi mutanda (60) mubutali elyo na makubiti amakumi yabili (20) mubwipi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3:3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ekutila, iŋanda yali mubutali bamita amakumi yabili na cine lubali (27m), mubwipi bamita pabula (9m).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ukubomfya icipimo cakale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuputule wa pa mwinshi wa ŋanda walepele amakubiti amakumi yabili (20) ukucilinganya mubwipi, elyo amakubiti amakumi yabili (20) ukulola mumulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3:4",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ekutila, umuputule wa pa mwinshi walepele bamita pabula (9m) mukucilinganya mubwipi, elyo bamita pabula (9m) ukulola mumulu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Akupa mukati golide wine wine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atantika imbao sha fimuti fya paini mu muputule ukalamba, ashingulako na golide iyawamishiwa bwino. Alengapo no tuncindu ne minyololo iyapikana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayanshika mu ŋanda utumabwe utwayemba. Kabili abomfya na golide wa ku Pafaimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ashingula golide ku myalo ya mu mutenge, ku nceshi, ku fibumba elyo na ku fiibi fya mu ŋanda, abasa na bakerubi pa fibumba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.26.33+EXO.26.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ukuf 26:33-34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akuula Umuputule uwamushilo icine cine. Ubutali bwauko ukucilinganya iŋanda walepele amakubiti amakumi yabili (20) elyo na makubiti amakumi yabili mubwipi (20).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3:8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ekutila, umuputule uwamushilo cine cine wali bamita pabula (9m) mubutali, na mukucilinganya bamita pabula (9m).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ashingula mukati monse na golide uwawamishiwa bwino uwa matalanta imyanda mutanda (600)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3:8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "amatalanta 600:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ekutila amakilo amakana amakumi yabili na limo (21,000 kg) aya golide.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "insunga sha golide shafinine ukucila citika wa kilo. Kabili ashingula golide mu ncende sha pamulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.25.18+EXO.25.19+EXO.25.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ukuf 25:18-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu muputule wamushilo icine cine apangilamo bakerubi babili, ashingulako na golide. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amapindo ya bakerubi yalepele amakubiti amakumi yabili (20).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3:11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ekutila, bamita bane na citika (4.5m).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ipindo limo lyalepele amakubiti yasano",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3:11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ekutila, lyacilako panono bamita babili (2.25m).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kabili lyashinta mu cibumba ca ŋanda, elyo ipindo libiye nalyo lyalepele amakubiti yasano, lyena lyasuntinkana ne pindo lyakwa kerubi umbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili mu musango umo wine ipindo limo ilyakwa kerubi wabubili lyalepele amakubiti yasano",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3:12",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ekutila, lyacilako panono bamita babili (2.25m).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " elyo lyashinta ku cibumba cibiye ica ŋanda, ne pindo libiye nalyo lyalepele amakubiti yasano nalyo lyasuntinkana ne pindo lyakwa kerubi wantanshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubutali bwa mapindo ya bakerubi ninshi nayasuntinkana yalepele amakubiti amakumi yabili (20).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3:13",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ekutila, bamita bane na citika (4.5m).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bapangilwe nabeminina pa makasa yabo baloseshe amenso ku muputule ukalamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apanga icisalu icakucingako ku bushishi bwacifufya, ubwakashikila no bwakashika cee elyo ne nsalu iyabuuta iyapikulwa ubusaka, iyo bapikwilepo bakerubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.7.15+1KI.7.16+1KI.7.17+1KI.7.18+1KI.7.19+1KI.7.20+1KI.7.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Isham 7:15-21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apanga inceshi shibili kuntanshi ya ŋanda isho shonse ishalepele amakubiti amakumi yatatu na yasano (35),",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3:15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Shonse shibili capamo shalepele amamita ikumi limo na mutanda (16m), ekutila, cila luceshi lwalepele bamita cine konse konse (8m) ukulola mu mulu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " na cila luceshi lwali no mutwe pamulu uwali amakubiti yasano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3:15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ekutila, wacilako panono bamita babili (2.25m).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apanga ne minyololo ya citabataba no kubika pa mulu wa fyaimikwa. Apanga na mateke umwanda umo (100), akambatika ku minyololo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aimika inceshi pantanshi ye Tempele, lumo ku kapinda ka ku kulyo lumo nalo ku kapinda ka ku kuso. Ulwa ku kapinda ka ku kulyo alwinika Yakini elyo ulwa ku kapinda ka ku kuso alwinika Boasi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
